From 29b128bd7312362b4ace74aceee2148329df5c1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Williams <213356824+q8itz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:52:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] runtime: executable switching, disc boot and host-thread
 FP state

- Switch between default.xex and recompiled secondary executables in
  process, including returning to default.xex from the secondary title.
- Boot from a disc image passed as --game_data_root.
- Resolve drive-less shader include paths on the disc.
- Seed the FP control word for host threads entering guest code so SSE
  exceptions stay masked.
- Unlink the guest memory shm file right after creation so killed runs
  do not leak /dev/shm.
- Accept the default keyboard text when GRAW_ACCEPT_KEYBOARD is set.
